---
title: Sequence 5 - GET /api/patients/{patient}/visits (List Visits)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Authenticated Client
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant MW as Auth Middleware
    participant Policy as VisitPolicy
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>API: GET /api/patients/{patient}/visits Authorization Bearer token
    API->>MW: Verify Sanctum token
    MW-->>API: Authenticated
    API->>API: Resolve Patient via route model binding
    alt Patient not found
        API-->>Client: 404 Not Found
    else Patient found
        API->>Policy: authorize('viewAny', [Visit, patient])
        alt admin or doktor
            Policy-->>API: Allowed
        else pacijent requesting own visits
            Policy-->>API: Allowed
        else pacijent requesting another patient visits
            Policy-->>API: Denied
            API-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
        end
        API->>DB: SELECT visits WHERE patient_id = ? with doctor eager load
        DB-->>API: Visit collection with doctors
        API-->>Client: 200 VisitResource collection JSON
    end
